## TESTING

### Run Tests
```bash
cargo test
```

### Write Tests
Add tests in `tests/` directory:
```rust
#[test]
fn test_my_feature() {
    let result = run_source("set x to 10");
    assert!(result.is_ok());
}
```

### Redblue Test Syntax
```redblue
// test "my test case"
//   set x to 10
//   if x is 10
//       say "Pass"
//   end
// end
```

